{"id":"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-promise-ma.md","title":"承诺版 Merlin–Arthur 类","display":"df-promise-ma — 承诺版 Merlin–Arthur 类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-promise-ma","aliases":["28-df-promise-ma"],"display":"df-promise-ma — 承诺版 Merlin–Arthur 类","depends_on":["[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","[[28-df-promise-problem]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_book_location":"§23.4 definition of PromiseMA","source_printed_pages":"504","source_pdf_pages":"530","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-promise-ma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-promise-ma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-promise-ma — 承诺版 Merlin–Arthur 类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" href=\"?note=3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" title=\"28-df-promise-problem\">28-df-promise-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§23.4 definition of PromiseMA"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"504"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"530"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_f,N_f\">\\(Y_f,N_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" href=\"?note=3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" title=\"28-df-promise-problem\">28-df-promise-problem</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(u)\">\\(M(u)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(u)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(u)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布，随机带在证明固定后独立抽样。单比特串与相应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 认同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M(x,y;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(y,r))),\\qquad\\operatorname{time}_M(x,y;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(y,r)))\\quad(x,y,r\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M(x,y;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(y,r))),\\qquad\\operatorname{time}_M(x,y;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(y,r)))\\quad(x,y,r\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^a}\\;\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;(\\operatorname{time}_M(x,y;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^{a+b+1}\\land M(x,y;r)\\in\\{0,1\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in Y_f\\;\\exists y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^a}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x,y;r)=1]\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in N_f\\;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^a}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x,y;r)=1]\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^a}\\;\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;(\\operatorname{time}_M(x,y;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^{a+b+1}\\land M(x,y;r)\\in\\{0,1\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in Y_f\\;\\exists y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^a}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x,y;r)=1]\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in N_f\\;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+1)^a}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x,y;r)=1]\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Merlin 的证明 y 在随机串抽取之前固定；若允许看完 r 再选 y，就改变类。时间界对所有输入、证明、随机串成立，yes/no 成功条件仅限制承诺域。幂次可增大以吸收任意多项式时间。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.4 definition of PromiseMA；印刷页 504；PDF 页 530。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-promise-problem","status":"resolved","id":"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-promise-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-promise-problem","status":"resolved","id":"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}$；$Y_f,N_f$ 见 [[28-df-promise-problem]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(u)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(u)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布，随机带在证明固定后独立抽样。单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excer